        "instruction": "I. LISTENING - Part 3: You will hear an interview with awoman called Kate Lindholm, who works as a botanicalillustrator for scientific journals and flora guides. Forquestions 11-15, choose the answer (A, B, C or D) which fitsbest according to what you hear.",
