        "instruction": "I. LISTENING - Part 3: You will hear an interview with a woman called Clara Vance, who works as a forensic book conservator. For questions 11-15, choose the answer (A, B, C or D) which fits best according to what you hear.",
        "text": "What does Clara say about her educational background and training?",
